  "description": "This is a super nice Hachita build featuring a super light carbon gravel wheel set.\n\nBuilt on our medium ..54cm.\n\nPerfect blend of old tech that works and a few modern bits to make it perfect.\n\nChallenge tires, 40c for fast while staying comfy. The front rim is a dimpled zipp 404 laced radially to a carbon hed hub. 18h. Super aero where it counts. Rear is a generic carbon hoop laced radial nds, 3x ds to the matching hed carbon hub. Looove these wheels.\n\nDowntube shifted sram force 9sp. Shifters might change to make sure it's dialed in when you receive it.\n\nSome of my favorite NOS trp canti brakes for some classic cx vibes.\n\nRotor cranks, brooks saddle, drilled TRP levers. What a perfect mix.\n\nOur Pebblito gravel bars and lightweight brazed stem. This thing is ready to rip.",
